# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Sheets data source
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Leave SHEET_ID unset to run entirely on the committed snapshot in
# lib/data/seed.ts (fine for local dev and the first deploy).
#
# Set SHEET_ID to the workbook's file id to read the LIVE tabs. The workbook
# must be shared so that "Anyone with the link" can VIEW it (or Published to
# the web). No API key, no OAuth — the app fetches each tab as CSV from:
#   https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/<SHEET_ID>/gviz/tq?tqx=out:csv&sheet=<TAB>
#
# The id is the long string in the sheet URL:
#   https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/ 1AbC...XyZ /edit
#                                           ^^^^^^^^^^^ this part
#
# Tab names must match exactly: LEAGUE_STATUS, L_CAREERS, CHAMPIONS, AWARDS,
# HALL_OF_FAME, L_RECORDS, L_EVENTS, X_PERSONALITIES
#
# Live data is cached for 5 minutes (revalidate) so edits show up shortly after.

# SHEET_ID=
